 "mandatory_caption_caveat": "COMPUTATIONAL efficiency only, measured as latency. No power or energy measurement exists anywhere in this project, so no energy-efficiency claim is made. The two panels are two separate frontiers on two different nodes and are NEVER merged: the fusion bridge control failed its pre-registered 10 per cent tolerance at -18.69 per cent and no adjustment factor is applied. Only END_TO_END_SERIAL rows appear; cached and head-only figures are never plotted here. E7a's additive sums and the Pareto fronts built on them are superseded. E9 is contextual positioning, not a fair-protocol superiority claim, and E10's B4/B4r have no timing evidence of any kind.",
